msgid "Mail Pro is a standalone separate plugin. It adds Sent-folder reading, folder creation and renaming, search, 20-message pages, bulk MOVE, Trash and restore to INBOX. Changes require administrator access, form nonce and explicit confirmation. Permanent deletion is not provided."
msgstr "Mail Pro is a standalone separate plugin. It adds Sent-folder reading, folder creation and renaming, search, 20-message pages, bulk MOVE, Trash and restore to INBOX. Changes require administrator access, form nonce and explicit confirmation. Permanent deletion is not provided."

msgid "Mail Pro keeps independent account options, encrypted credentials and distinct PHP classes, admin URLs and text domain. It does not need Lite, Core or WooCommerce to operate, and it never alters their stored settings."
msgstr "Mail Pro keeps independent account options, encrypted credentials and distinct PHP classes, admin URLs and text domain. It does not need Lite, Core or WooCommerce to operate, and it never alters their stored settings."

msgid "Select Mail Pro > Inbox, Sent, Folders or Trash. Use Search and Next/Previous to find older mail, read messages without changing their read status and select up to 20 messages per page for an explicit MOVE action."
msgstr "Select Mail Pro > Inbox, Sent, Folders or Trash. Use Search and Next/Previous to find older mail, read messages without changing their read status and select up to 20 messages per page for an explicit MOVE action."

msgid "Use Compose for plain-text SMTP sending; Pro attempts to APPEND a copy to the server Sent folder when SMTP accepts it. If no Sent folder exists or the append fails, a specific notice warns you. One recipient per message; no attachments."
msgstr "Use Compose for plain-text SMTP sending; Pro attempts to APPEND a copy to the server Sent folder when SMTP accepts it. If no Sent folder exists or the append fails, a specific notice warns you. One recipient per message; no attachments."

msgid "Use Test IMAP and a test SMTP message on a dedicated mailbox. Check that the server supports RFC MOVE and has a Trash and Sent folder. Folder operations change the server mailbox; no destructive action is run by Autocheck."
msgstr "Use Test IMAP and a test SMTP message on a dedicated mailbox. Check that the server supports RFC MOVE and has a Trash and Sent folder. Folder operations change the server mailbox; no destructive action is run by Autocheck."

msgid "Functionality Check verifies local encryption, IMAP and SMTP prerequisites and configuration. Code Check only checks PHP parsing and is not a security audit. Neither test performs remote mailbox changes; explicit IMAP connection and SMTP test are required."
msgstr "Functionality Check verifies local encryption, IMAP and SMTP prerequisites and configuration. Code Check only checks PHP parsing and is not a security audit. Neither test performs remote mailbox changes; explicit IMAP connection and SMTP test are required."
